{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/955966-importing-1e-athanors-into-2e","id":955966,"title":"Importing 1e Athanors into 2e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-22T16:25:51-07:00","id":955966,"title":"Importing 1e Athanors into 2e","content":"On another thread, I suggested importing 1e's Athanor mechanics into 2e by carving them up into three parts (Affinity Attributes, Boons, and the Reagent fuel stat) and incorporating them into 2e separately. Affinity Attributes become crunch for the Roles; Boons become part of an expanded Bestowments system; and Reagent becomes a product of a variant of the Vitriol Fount. Taking these in order:","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T16:26:24-07:00","id":955969,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Affinity Traits</span></b><br /> Affinity Traits become crunch for Roles: that is, every Role gets two Affinity Traits that can be improved using Vitriol while you'r in that Role. <br /> <br /> <u>Mimics</u><br /> Companion: ___, ___<br /> Follower: ___, ___<br /> Leader: ___, ___<br /> <u>Pariahs</u><br /> Hermit: ___, ___<br /> Sage: ___, ___<br /> Watcher: ___, ___<br /> <u>Titans</u><br /> Exemplar: ___, ___<br /> Martyr: ___, ___<br /> Soldier: ___, ___<br /> <u>Originists</u><br /> Chronicler: ___, ___<br /> Ascetic: ___, ___<br /> Pilgrim: ___, ___<br /> <u>Furies</u><br /> Outcast: ___, ___<br /> Savage: ___, ___<br /> Vigilante: ___, ___<br /> <u>Sentries</u><br /> Bodyguard: ___, ___<br /> Servant: ___, ___<br /> Seeker: ___, ___<br /> <u>Mystics</u><br /> Envoy: ___, ___<br /> Observer: ___, ___<br /> Warden: ___, ___<br /> <u>Catharsis</u><br /> Confessor: ___, ___<br /> Deviant: ___, ___<br /> Provocateur: ___, ___<br /> <u>Savants</u><br /> Craftsman: ___, ___<br /> Explorer: ___, ___<br /> Scientist: ___, ___<br /> <u>Light-Bringers</u><br /> Daredevil: ___, ___<br /> Psychopomp: ___, ___<br /> Whip: ___, ___","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-22-2016, 07:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T16:27:40-07:00","id":955970,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Promethean Boons</span></b><br /> Boons are a type of trait the you pick as your Azoth increases. You get your first Boon (called a Bestowment) at Azoth \u2022, and you get the right to purchase another one every two dots of Azoth after that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-22-2016, 07:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T16:28:22-07:00","id":955971,"title":"","content":"Reagent -.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-25T05:19:52-08:00","id":1498033,"title":"","content":"Reagents are Vitriol Font products, or something related to the Role/&quot;Athanor&quot; that you can acquire","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-22T12:25:26-07:00","id":1518558,"title":"","content":"Reagent could work like Pyros you can spend without contributing to a Wasteland. Though I do wonder if that might too much of a must-get.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28116-tzies","name":"Tzies","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T23:45:21-07:00","id":1522084,"title":"","content":"Athanors in 1st edition are aiming to be something very different than what they are in 2nd. The former was focused on preparing the body for the New Dawn while the later is more about teaching &amp; Azothic Memory.<br /> So we can classify them as specific type of Athanor. I'm inclined to refer them as &quot;Physique Athanors.&quot; <br /> It would still tie back to Lineages and explains why the Promethean Boons are called as Bestowments <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/955966-importing-1e-athanors-into-2e?p=955970#post955970\">(as per the earlier post.)</a> The Redeemed Boon on the other hand, is not so easy to explain. But they are technically the whole reason 1st edition even exist in universe.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how Affinity traits are going to work, which limits my ability to contribute here. In 1st edition they were used as another way to turn vitriol on non-Promethean specific traits. Tying them to Roles is a little...confusing. <br /> <br /> On the matter of Reagent...It still should cost Vitriol to acquire points (that still regenerate given time), should not contribute to Wasteland and only can be spent on a limited number of options. Perhaps related to the Affinity Trait/Roles?<br /> <br /> Maybe we should look at an example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}